<title>UK: Greenalls full year profits up 48 percent.</title>
<headline>Greenalls full year profits up 48 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year ended September 27</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		38.5		   vs 35.0</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 15.4		   vs 14.2</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-exceps     148.7		  vs 100.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     111.3		  vs 100.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.123 bln	    vs 744.98</p>
<p>NOTE - Underlying pretax profit excludes the contribution from Boddington acquired in November 1995 and exceptional items of 31.2 million, including 23.9 million of reorganisation costs at Boddington.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 140 and 150 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Greenalls Plc.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
